Version 4
SymbolType BLOCK
LINE Normal 5 0 -16 0
LINE Normal 10 0 32 0
LINE Normal 5 9 5 -9
LINE Normal 10 -9 10 9
LINE Normal 10 -9 10 -9
TEXT -13 -11 Left 2 Exp
SYMATTR Prefix X
SYMATTR SpiceModel C_exp
SYMATTR Value length=1
SYMATTR ModelFile impedance.lib
SYMATTR Value2 C=100n XC=0 IC=0 fn={fn1}
SYMATTR Description capacitor with exponential swingin
SYMATTR SpiceLine TD=0 texp=25ms
PIN -16 0 NONE 8
PINATTR PinName L1_1
PINATTR SpiceOrder 1
PIN 32 0 NONE 8
PINATTR PinName L1_2
PINATTR SpiceOrder 2
